    </div>
    <div class="description">You will describe each recommendation, identify a specific standard or regulation, and then explain how your recommendation would align Texas A&amp;M University- San Antonio's program with that specific standard or regulation. You should include supporting data.

Specifically, the following critical elements must be addressed:

1. Recommendation: Offer three to five specific recommendations that would improve Texas A&amp;M University- San Antonio's academic program under evaluation.
2. Standards and Regulations: Identify at least one specific standard or regulation for each recommendation. Include the complete text of the standard or regulation as well as its source.
3. Alignment: Explain how each recommendation would align their program with the specific standard or regulation you identified.</div>
